          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:13.20.390:block:1",
          "start": 496
        },
        "quote": "It is the user’s sole responsibility to modify the facility as necessary to produce an effluent acceptable to the Division under the provisions of this chapter or any regulations established by the Division. Any subsequent changes in the facilities or methods of operation shall be reported to the Division prior to changes in the facilities or methods of operation. (Ord. 19496 § 60, 12-21-10; Ord. 16388 § 7.17, 11-5-91. Code 1995 § 146-288. Formerly 14.80.480.)",
